MAXID:35

50:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: I'm glad I can finally meet you in person, fortune teller.
51:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: Please, call me Iris. What brings you here?
52:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: You know what. You can see the future.
53:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: Agreed. But I want to know how much you're willing to sacrifice to defeat your enemy.
54:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: I've already lost everything, so I have nothing left but life.
55:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: You're supposed to be a ruler, but you're shortsighted. 
56:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: ...?
57:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: Truth also believed that when he lost his family, he had nothing left. But in the end, he realized he had more than ever. And you, haven't you forgotten what else you have?
58:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: I still have my father, but he left Artidram. Although... There are still friends, I can count on them.
59:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: That's right. No one is ever alone. That's the greatest support. Support that's still alive.
60:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: How do you know?
61:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: I'm a fortune teller... I'm kidding. I met them two days ago and gave them support. The daughter of Karion himself.
62:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: Attilia?? Is she alive?
63:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: Yes. And she will lead Valtaria's new army to victory.
64:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: But they won't be able to cope, no matter how large an army they have. He who has my armor and axe is unbeatable.
65:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: Still, your faith is petty.
66:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: You know what you can do with this equipment. Level 11 technology. Even the Earthlings couldn't figure it out and had to make a copy. In the wrong hands... Faith... Yes, faith... My father told me how Truth, during the negotiations, didn't use armor or an axe. He was defenseless.
67:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: Are you sure he was defenseless?
68:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: Not entirely. When a king sent troops against him at that time, or tried to intimidate him, he was able to defeat them with his bare hands and escape even the worst situations unscathed, which is obviously impossible without powers or artifacts. He must have had something.
69:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: Yes, how could I not have guessed? On my father's shelf, there was always a figurine of a soldier with a raised hand, and on it a glove. He also had one in the other. Those are the famous gloves of existence. Whoever possessed them was able to create and destroy with them.
70:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: I just have no idea where they might be; my father never told me about it.
71:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: Do you remember where he was buried?
72:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: In the middle of the ocean. I don't know where. But you certainly know where it is.
73:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: I know a lot, but not everything.
74:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: Well, even if they did exist, they probably don't exist anymore.
75:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: What do you mean? 76:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: Truth's armor was made of Amelithum, Orion's steel. However, after the destruction of all Equirium, Orion and everything connected to him were destroyed, even the armor and the axe.
77:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: If the gauntlets were made of the same material, they no longer exist.
78:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: Don't lose faith, Dyron. It's what drives us to do good. It will be useful to you in the darkest of times.
79:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: One more thing, before I leave. What awaits Valtaria? Will everything be as it was before?
80:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: I can tell you one thing. When you truly return there, you will find it in flames and suffering.
81:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: It's over, Dyron, my time is drawing near. Everything will end and begin anew in a great mountain surrounded by jungle.
82:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: How so?
83:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: Tell Malcolm I'll watch over him.
84:[$FFB1B9]Dyron[$ffffff]: Why? What's the matter?
85:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: Someone is waiting for me on the beach, please don't follow me.

86:[$303030]Commander[$ffffff]: Tribe of Destillion. If you care about this woman's life, I advise you not to approach. I am Teth, and I'm taking your fortune teller with me. So no sudden movements.
87:[$0909F6]Barbarian[$ffffff]: Harm her, and you will pay dearly.
88:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: Calm down, my people. Nothing will happen to me.
89:[$303030][$303030]Teth[$ffffff]:[$ffffff]: Very well. We need to talk seriously, witch.
90:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: I've been expecting your visit for a long time.
91:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: Yes, I know? 
92:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: How is my son?
93:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: He's not your son. You killed his parents.
94:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: They betrayed me, both of them. They didn't deserve to live.
95:[$0909F6]Iris[$ffffff]: That's why you'll lose soon.
96:[$303030]Teth[$ffffff]: We'll see.